Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:04:00.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《移动迷宫2：焦土试炼》
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.53,1:21:48.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（A区）
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.81,1:52:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,B-4\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.82,1:52:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-4\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.16,1:52:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-6\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.17,1:52:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,B-3\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒 我们得马上走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up! We gotta go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们要走了 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go! We gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒虫 有毒虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cranks! We got Cranks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上转移 这里不安全 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta move! Not safe out here, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一大群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a swarm to the flank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 孩子们 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, kid! Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,设置一条警戒线 让他们退到右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a perimeter! Hold them back on the right side!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了孩子们 我们走吧 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids, let's go! Let's go! Move it! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直走 不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们离开 这里安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to take off! We're clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kids doing all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对所有的事情很抱歉 我们要对付那群东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about all the fuss. We had ourselves a bit of a swarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你们还活着的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the reason you're all still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们活着也是我的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my intention to keep you that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟我来吧 我们会带你们去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come with me. We'll get you kids squared away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以叫我詹森先生 这地方是由我来负责的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me Mr. Janson. I run this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说这是个避难所 不受外面恐怖的世界侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}For us it is a sanctuary, safe from the horrors of the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都应该把这当作是一个中转站\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all should think of it as a way station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个家之间的另一个家 看着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a home between homes. Watch yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是带我们回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mean you're taking us home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种各样的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A home of sorts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 无论你来自哪里都没多少人生存了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, there wouldn't be much left of wherever you came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有一个适合你们的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do have a place for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面焦土区的一个避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}A refuge, outside the Scorch, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个实验部永远也不会找到你们的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where WICKED will never find you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you helping us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.85,0:05:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就说这世界在一个相当危险的形势吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say the world out there is in a rather precarious situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all hanging on by a very thin thread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上你们可以从闪焰病毒幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you kids can survive the Flare virus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是成为人类继续生存的最好希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you the best chance of humanity's continued survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 这同时也让你们成为目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, it also makes you a target, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问你们现在已经注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as no doubt by now you've noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,越过这门就是你们新生活的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond this door lies the beginning of your new lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我们先解决体味的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's do something about that smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,费平 感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frypan, how you feel over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点餐前开胃菜 钙 叶酸 维生素A到Z\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little cocktail. Calcium, folate, vitamins A through Z.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎都是你在外面一直缺少的营养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much everything you've been deprived of out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你取够血了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you got enough there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 克劳福德医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, Dr. Crawford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 新来的人适应的怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. How are the new arrivals holding up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前来说还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是特丽莎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must be Teresa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢你来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you for seeing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉麻烦到你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for the inconvenience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望我们 可以远离他们就我们两人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just hoping we might get a moment to chat in private, away from the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会用你太多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't take up too much of your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我只有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really only have one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得实验部些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember about WICKED?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有惹上麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在谈谈 只是想搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just having a conversation. I'm just trying to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是站在哪一边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose side are you on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我以前是给实验部工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember I used to work for WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他们送我进迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that they sent me into the maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得 我看着我的朋友在我面前死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember watching my friends die in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他们那边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on their side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你曾经为实验部工作 但他们送你进迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you worked for WICKED, but they sent you into the maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they do something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许你应该在杀他们之前问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe you should've asked them before you killed them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会谨记这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be sure to keep that in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受你在这里休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the rest of your stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你已经说了所有我需要知道的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've told me everything I need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友都被没问题 可以加入到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your friends have all been cleared to join the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你们会去到更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you'll all be moving on to greener pastures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 米诺怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Minho, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷宫不止一个 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't the only maze. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一声巨大的爆炸 而这些人不知从哪里冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was this big, loud explosion, and these guys came out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那开始开枪扫射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started shooting up the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常激烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was intense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我们带出迷宫 然后带我们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pulled us out of the maze and brought us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他留在迷宫里的人 他们怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other people left behind in the maze, what happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜实验部还留着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess WICKED still has them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在这多长时间了 - 没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long you guys been here? - Not long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有1或2天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a day or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里的那个孩子 他在这里最久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid over there has been here the longest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎一个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的迷宫就只有女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}His maze was nothing but girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人就是运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guys have all the luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 先生们 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, gentlemen. Ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道该怎么做 如果你听到你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know how this works. If you hear your name called…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请有序的站起来 然后来我身后的同事这边…\N{\fnArial\fs30}please rise in an orderly fashion, join my colleagues behind me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会护送你们去东侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they will escort you to the eastern wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的新生活即将开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new lives are about to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊夫林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊夫林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ev!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jusfin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,史昆纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squigee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林和阿比盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin. And Abigail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你们不要灰心 如果我可以带更多的人 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, don't get discouraged. If I could take more, I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都有机会 会轮到你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always tomorrow. Your time will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吃饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, eat up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些混蛋真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似农场的地方 一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of farm. A safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一次只能带你们几个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can only take in a couple of people at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要带她去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they taking her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是多做几个测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just have to run a few more tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他们很快就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, they'll be done with her soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got top bunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以习惯这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could get used to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不算差啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这些人想从特丽莎身上得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what do you think those guys want with Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这女孩的一件事 就是她能照顾好自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if there's one thing I know about that girl, she can take care of herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下 我们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a second. What the hell are we doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要错过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're gonna miss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们每天晚上都带一个新的进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bring in new ones every night like clockwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们对他们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they do with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这事我还没搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. This is as far as I've ever gotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿连排气管都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vents don't even go into that section.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但自从他们进去后 他们就没再出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once they go through that door, they don't come back out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想从来没有人可以离开这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anybody ever really leaves this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要在有人发觉我们不见了之前回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We've gotta go before somebody notices we're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么给我看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you show me this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为也许其他人会听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because maybe the others will listen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有些怪异的事情 而我知道你也是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something weird going on here. And I know you think so too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samantha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道那门后是通往什么地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know what's through that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们已经讨论过这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we've been over this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他们被遮盖了 所以你不知道你看见的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they were covered up, so you don't know what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼斯 - 这可以是任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dennis. - It could've been anything under there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看见的是什么 他们是尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what I saw. They were bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯说他们每天晚上都带一批新的进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris said they bring in a new batch every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的阿里斯是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is Aris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,提姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最后一个但这不重要 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And last but not least, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的配合 希望你今晚过的愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your attention. Enjoy the rest of your evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 直到我们知道这是什么事之前 我们应该低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, until we know anything for certain, we should just keep our heads down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量别引起任何注意 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try not to draw any attention to ourselves, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是去干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他在引起注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's drawing attention to himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你没有被叫上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. You weren't called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我就进去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I'm just gonna be a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是限制区域 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a restricted area, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想去见我的朋友 你能让我过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna see my friend. Can you let me through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你的位子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass back in that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住 监视器会监视你们的一举一动 如果有谁违反规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember, you are always being monitored. Breaking the rules…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 到底怎么啦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem, man? What the hell, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们不让人过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you let me see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制好你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control your friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们可以互相信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could trust each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们在这是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we're all on the same team here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们去他们的房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them to their bunks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全部进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your asses in there! All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真认为 他们会就这样让你过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't really think they were just gonna let you through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, of course I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找出门的另一边是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find out what's on the other side of that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特 他们在隐藏了些东西 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt, they're hiding something. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人不是像他们说的那样子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are not who they say they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 托马斯 你根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Thomas, you don't know that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一我们知道是他们把我们从实验部那救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that we do know is that they helped rescue us from WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给我们新衣服 给我们食物 给我们正常的床\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave us new clothes. They gave us food. They gave us a proper bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些人很长时间没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us haven't had that in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些人比其他人更长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us a lot longer than others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 也许你们是对的 也许我只是有妄想症\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, maybe you guys are right. Maybe I'm just being paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要去确认一下 就给我掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got to find out for sure. Just cover for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back as soon as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在第一晚就带走她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took her the first night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她说过会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her it was going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这不能再等了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this can't wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很明确 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was very specific, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要你亲自跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to speak with you personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我没能力处理好似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if I don't have enough to deal with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等我一下 我们在受到风暴的干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bear with me. I'm getting some interference from the storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 这够好了 快连接吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's good enough. Make the connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 佩姬博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Doctor Paige.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.81,0:21:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我承认我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I admit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有料到这么快收到你的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't expecting to hear from you quite so soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变 詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans, Janson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会比预期早一点到 就明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be arriving a little sooner than expected. First thing tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能来我们会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be delighted to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会对我们取得的进展感到满意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be pleased with the progress we've made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所见 前期的成果都是非常有前途的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, early results have been extremely promising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你在那里对他们做的是什么 这已经有效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is you've been doing to them in there, it's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not well enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚收到董事会的批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just received board approval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要所有剩下的研究对像进入昏迷状态 准备收割\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all the remaining subjects sedated and prepped for harvest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在到达前做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the time I arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩姬博士 我们会尽快完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Paige, we are going as fast as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在测试中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are still running tests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try something faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我能保证他们安全 这是最好的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I can guarantee their security, this is the best plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 安全是我的工作 我们这是24小时封锁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, security is my job. We're on 24 hour lockdown here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am assuring you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验体都是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the assets are secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到干将了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you found the Right Arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在山上跟踪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tracked them as far as the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们已经攻击了我们2个设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've already hit two of our installations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟我们一样都想要这些孩子 而我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want these kids as badly as we do. And I cannot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再承受其他损失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot afford another loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码不能在我接近成功研制出解药时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, when I am so close to a cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能完成任务 我会另找其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are not up to the task, I will find someone who is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们从最近的新人开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I suggest we start with the most recent arrivals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快去完成它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想他们感觉到任何痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them to feel any pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么都感觉不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't feel a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.65,0:23:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. We gotta go right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么 - 你说「我们要走了」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you talking about? - What do you mean, "We gotta go?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须要来 来吧 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming. Come on. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要找我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佩姬 她还活着 - 在那里发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Paige. She's still alive. - What happened in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯 发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 你能冷静下来跟我们说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, can you just calm down and talk to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还活着 - 她是谁 特丽莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's still alive. - Who's she? Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.67,0:23:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能转过身来跟我们说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you just turn around and talk to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是实验部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's WICKED!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还是实验部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一直都是实验部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always been WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快走 有些事我必须要去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys go ahead. There's something I gotta do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.78,0:24:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这很重要 你们想离开这里 对吧 就快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it's important. You guys wanna get outta here, right? Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 温斯顿 走吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Winston, go! Go! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信我们能相信这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we can trust this kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道你在外面是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know where we'd be without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在外面这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you kids doing out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要封锁这里 叫所有人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this place locked down. Call everyone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.93,0:25:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非死了 不然任何人都不许离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one leaves until everyone's accounted for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到他们就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you've got eyes on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.48,0:25:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在寻找 还在寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still looking, still looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.98,0:25:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.28,0:25:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳福德 他们在找那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crawford. Going after the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,带所有人去医疗区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everyone to the med wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.24,0:25:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他们活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.00,0:25:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么他们会向我们开枪 - 我已经在阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are they shooting at us? - I've spotted them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在L-3 - 米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're in L-3! - Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.13,0:25:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在跟踪 - 你他妈的在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in pursuit! - What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.88,0:25:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.77,0:26:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走 来吧 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go. Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳福德博士 你来这里是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Crawford, are you here to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特丽莎 - 蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teresa. - Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.21,0:26:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 伸出你的手 - 照他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, hands, give me your hands! - Just do what he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们永远也逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna get away with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.14,0:26:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要马上离开这里 马上 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta leave right now. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.77,0:26:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 他们来了 我们该去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? They're coming! Where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.14,0:26:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,费平 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frypan! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.81,0:26:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去 回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.65,0:26:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把门挡住了 叫后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got the door barricaded. Send backup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we gotta get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:26:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该从哪走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:26:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.24,0:27:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特 来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt! Help, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.62,0:27:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.71,0:27:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.54,0:27:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 让人去另外一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on! - Get someone on the other side!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.09,0:27:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your feet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.50,0:27:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 走 - 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! Let's go! - Come on, move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Okay, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.86,0:27:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这 就是这 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is! There it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.61,0:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部向3层靠拢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Converge on level 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}All R-16 personnel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用非致命性武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}non-lethal force only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.79,0:27:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:27:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门 詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open this door, Janson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't want me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开这该死的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the damn door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我是想救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! I'm trying to save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂不说迷宫是一回事 但你们在焦土区不会维持到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maze is one thing, but you kids wouldn't last one day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,1天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}out in the Scorch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.14,0:28:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果环境杀不死你 毒虫会杀你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the elements don't kill you, the Cranks will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, you have to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.82,0:28:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want what's best for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 让我猜猜 实验部是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let me guess. WICKED is good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.66,0:28:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会通过那道门的 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting through that door, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.12,0:28:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas! Come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.05,0:28:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上 上 阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go. Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.22,0:28:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上主走廊门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the main vault door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 托马斯 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Thomas! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.23,0:28:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 走 - 托马斯 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! Move! - Thomas, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.16,0:29:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 托马斯 我们走吧 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Thomas. Let's go. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.71,0:29:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.77,0:29:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,成扇形散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fan out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.25,0:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快走 我们会在风暴里甩掉他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go! Go! We'll lose them in the storm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.88,0:30:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所用人员打开视觉通讯器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notify on visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看见他们在围墙这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see them over here at the fence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 低点 低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, go, go, go. Stay low. Stay low!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.57,0:30:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 等一下 我们要呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa, hang on. Stay together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.61,0:30:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们甩掉他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.07,0:30:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 伙计们 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going, guys. Let's go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 我们到底在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Where are we even going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.03,0:30:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 阿里斯 我们走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Aris. Let's go. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.25,0:30:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.05,0:30:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特丽莎 等等 不 不要进去 - 特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teresa, wait! No, don't go in there! - Teresa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.75,0:30:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 来吧 - 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, come on! - Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.76,0:30:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走 进去这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris, get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.39,0:30:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓住这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hold onto this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.82,0:31:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.61,0:31:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要继续走 - 不 托马斯 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta keep moving. - No. Thomas, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.62,0:31:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.83,0:31:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是实验部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.79,0:31:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是实验部 他们骗了我们 我们从来就没逃离过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's WICKED. They lied to us. We never escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.46,0:31:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和阿里斯 我们找到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Aris, we found bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.46,0:31:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,多的数不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many to count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思 尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Dead bodies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.68,0:31:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但他们也不是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but they weren't alive either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他们吊起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had them strung up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.14,0:31:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们身上插满管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With tubes coming out of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.63,0:31:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.98,0:31:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被抽干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were being drained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的体内有实验部想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something inside of us that WICKED wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些在我门血液里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in our blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.86,0:31:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要尽可能的离他们远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to get as far away from them as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.66,0:32:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, what's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有计划的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a plan, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟着你来到这里 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we followed you out here, Thomas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.01,0:32:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在你说你不知道我们在去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're saying that you have no idea where we're going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.01,0:32:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what we're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.47,0:32:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 詹森说过些什么关于有人藏在山里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Janson said something about people hiding in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.18,0:32:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似反抗的人或军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of resistance or army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.73,0:32:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干将\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Right Arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,干将 如果他们真的跟实验部对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Right Arm. If they're really against WICKED, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they can help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.36,0:32:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 在山里 山里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People. In the mountains. Mountain people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.49,0:32:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.54,0:32:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only chance we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.17,0:32:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.17,0:32:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺 灯照过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho, give me a light!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.01,0:32:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.61,0:33:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 打门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.67,0:33:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像有人生活在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like people lived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.17,0:33:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们现在去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.59,0:33:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿点这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pack some of this stuff up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何你觉得可能需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you think you might need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分开走 看看还能找到什么 再回这里会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll split up, see what else we can find. Meet back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.77,0:33:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些留在那里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those kids that we left behind back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.46,0:34:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想像他们那样结束生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to end up like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.34,0:34:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.68,0:34:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在听我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.97,0:34:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.14,0:34:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们在这找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now, what are we looking for out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signs of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.15,0:34:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 生存者 任何能帮我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People. Survivors. Anyone who can help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.03,0:34:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he count?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.52,0:35:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.47,0:35:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.13,0:36:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.64,0:37:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来还可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks promising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.32,0:37:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 米诺 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Minho. Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.83,0:37:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back, get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.63,0:37:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.92,0:37:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.22,0:37:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.76,0:37:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.02,0:37:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta move! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.27,0:38:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.53,0:38:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顶住 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it down! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.03,0:38:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顶住 - 米诺 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it down! - Minho, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.47,0:38:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.51,0:38:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.97,0:38:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.56,0:38:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.77,0:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.78,0:38:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.24,0:38:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.16,0:38:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.07,0:38:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.83,0:38:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.62,0:38:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.58,0:39:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 米诺 这些是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, Minho, what the hell are those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.50,0:39:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 就继续跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Just keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.09,0:39:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.59,0:39:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跑去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.88,0:39:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.43,0:39:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.66,0:39:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿里斯 不要 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aris, no! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.94,0:39:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.12,0:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.50,0:39:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we gonna go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.92,0:39:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到离开这里的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find a way out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.21,0:39:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.59,0:39:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.68,0:39:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽特 - 纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Newt! - Newt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:39:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.94,0:40:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特 你你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt, you good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 谢谢 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks, Tommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.23,0:40:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 纽特 - 不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Newt! - Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过这里 穿过这里 快点 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through here, through here! Let's go! They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.49,0:40:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我们在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 快点 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, run! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.46,0:40:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要停下来 - 快点 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just keep going! - Come on, they're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.51,0:40:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dead end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.17,0:40:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带我们离开这里 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here, Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.35,0:40:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖延他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold them back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.35,0:40:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.19,0:40:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that door open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.69,0:40:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.86,0:40:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 费平 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Frypan! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.03,0:40:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 门开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! It's open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.86,0:40:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家过去 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone through! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.32,0:40:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.45,0:40:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.04,0:41:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.12,0:41:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力拉 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.21,0:41:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 温斯顿 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up, Winston! - Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺 走吧 我随后就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho, go! I'm right behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.89,0:41:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas. Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.77,0:42:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.66,0:42:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.08,0:42:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们目前安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think we're safe for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.13,0:42:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们应该继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we should get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.13,0:42:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快收拾好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pack it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.96,0:42:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.17,0:42:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,费平 温斯顿 我们出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fry, Winston. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.26,0:42:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.10,0:42:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.06,0:43:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.81,0:43:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.73,0:43:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像很久没有人在这里待过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look like anyone's been here in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.03,0:43:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望全世界都不像这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the whole world's not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.20,0:43:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.38,0:44:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.39,0:44:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人藏起来 藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, hide! Hide! Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.97,0:44:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去这里 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here. In here, in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.23,0:44:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.24,0:44:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远也不会停止寻找我们 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're never gonna stop looking for us, are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.34,0:44:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.43,0:44:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.78,0:45:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就差一点 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little further, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.46,0:45:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是这些山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those mountains, that's gotta be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.38,0:45:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.88,0:45:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a long way off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.68,0:45:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们最好继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we better get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.35,0:45:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 嘿 温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston! Hey, Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.98,0:45:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.19,0:45:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.69,0:45:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt pretty bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.86,0:45:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.70,0:45:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.49,0:45:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 你能听到我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston. Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.99,0:45:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持住 温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.43,0:46:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起他的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab his legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.98,0:46:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抬起了 我抬起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him, I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.66,0:46:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta find shelter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.31,0:47:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来山越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like they're getting further away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要继续走 我们就可以走到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta keep moving. We can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it looking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.07,0:47:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.08,0:47:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不会安慰人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not very convincing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.21,0:47:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's going on with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.38,0:47:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我做了些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did something to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.93,0:47:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我只是感觉 我像从梦中或什么的醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first it just felt like I was waking up from a dream or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.27,0:47:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它们就开始回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they all started coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.61,0:47:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your memories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.90,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.20,0:47:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他们第一次带你来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the first time they brought you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.12,0:47:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还比你高 而且跑的比你更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was taller than you then. And faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.29,0:47:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.13,0:48:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我们为什么在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember why we were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.59,0:48:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为我们能解决这一切问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we could fix all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.27,0:48:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 就听我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Just listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.28,0:48:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 回去？他们曾经那样对我们做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Go back? After everything they've done to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.03,0:48:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那么简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.24,0:48:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think it is that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.62,0:48:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.99,0:48:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我不明白什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What don't I understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.66,0:48:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来一切都很好 直到你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was fine until you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.75,0:48:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.00,0:48:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 你在告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa, what aren't you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.55,0:48:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 下来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston what are you doing, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.43,0:49:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把这个给我 - 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me that! - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.31,0:49:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就站起来拿起枪然后他想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just woke up and grabbed the gun and then he tried to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.48,0:49:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.94,0:49:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,温斯顿 温斯顿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.99,0:49:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在生长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's growing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.55,0:49:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑不下去的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.52,0:49:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.52,0:49:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我变成那些东西的中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me turn into one of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.75,0:50:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Newt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.85,0:50:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.10,0:50:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.65,0:50:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了 温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.75,0:50:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.95,0:51:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.25,0:51:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.04,0:51:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.38,0:52:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们应该是免疫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were supposed to be immune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.21,0:52:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不是全部人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.76,0:52:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果温斯顿能被感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Winston can get infected…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.18,0:52:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该假设我们都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should assume so can the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.10,0:52:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想到我会这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd say it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.48,0:52:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念林间空地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the Glade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.47,0:53:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.89,0:53:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.19,0:53:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特 来吧 我们要走了 起来 费平 阿里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt, get up. Come on, let's go. Frypan, Aris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.44,0:54:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.57,0:54:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.65,0:54:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.61,0:54:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是光\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.08,0:54:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.21,0:54:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 马上走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We gotta go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.64,0:54:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.98,0:54:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.19,0:54:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直跑 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.69,0:54:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.03,0:54:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Teresa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.95,0:54:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.07,0:54:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越来越近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting closer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.37,0:54:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑进去 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.93,0:55:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.15,0:55:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.66,0:55:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.91,0:55:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 扶他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.71,0:55:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.80,0:55:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.59,0:55:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.02,0:55:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.98,0:55:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.10,0:56:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got a light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.02,0:56:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.61,0:56:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 醒醒 - 米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on. - Minho?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.53,0:56:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.86,0:56:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒啊 米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Minho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.87,0:56:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.00,0:56:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.42,0:56:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.59,0:56:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来了 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.59,0:56:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.47,0:56:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被闪电击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.89,0:56:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们扶他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.31,0:56:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心慢慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.35,0:56:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.44,0:56:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.61,0:56:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能起来吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think you can get up? - Yep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.53,0:56:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.16,0:56:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.20,0:57:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.84,0:57:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.93,0:57:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.81,0:57:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你们跟我的看门狗见过面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've met our guard dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.48,0:57:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.57,0:57:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 站后点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back! Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.62,0:57:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来很糟糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys look like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.58,0:57:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.54,0:57:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们想跟他们一起呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want to stay here with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.85,0:58:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.11,0:58:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.65,0:58:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫想见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge wants to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.74,0:58:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是豪尔赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Jorge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.62,0:58:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没有人从焦土区逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's come out of the Scorch in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.00,0:58:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚让他很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just got him curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.75,0:58:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.34,0:58:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这地方开始有不好的感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else starting to get a bad feeling about this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就听他说 看看他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just hear him out. See what he has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.11,0:58:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫 他们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge, they're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.28,0:58:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.32,0:59:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有过全世界都跟你作对的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever get the feeling the whole world's against you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.89,0:59:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有3个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.42,0:59:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.97,0:59:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.18,0:59:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I profit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.32,0:59:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一次性全回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't all answer at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.41,0:59:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're headed for the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.96,0:59:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找干将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the Right Arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.41,0:59:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思是你在找幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for ghosts, you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.38,0:59:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question number two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.72,1:00:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.43,1:00:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.52,1:00:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.02,1:00:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell off me, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.35,1:00:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你这大娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you big baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.86,1:00:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.86,1:00:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.78,1:00:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是对的 她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about what? What is she talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.46,1:00:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.04,1:00:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你被标记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're tagged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.21,1:00:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来自实验部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came from WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.38,1:00:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're very valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.11,1:01:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的计划 托马斯 「就听听这男人说什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good plan, Thomas."Just hear what the man has to say."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.24,1:01:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们真有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really working out for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.95,1:01:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧 米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Minho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.91,1:01:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以 可以抓到绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can reach the rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.04,1:01:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欣赏风景吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying the view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的想要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.96,1:01:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.59,1:01:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人想把你们卖回去实验部\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men want to sell you back to WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.81,1:01:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活教会他们别想太多 我从来都不会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life has taught them to think small. I'm not like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西告诉我你也不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me that you're not either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.56,1:01:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是血冲昏我的头 还是这个家伙再说胡话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the blood rushing to my head or is this shank not making any sense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.32,1:01:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你们知道干将些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you know about the Right Arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.95,1:01:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你说他们是幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said they were ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.12,1:01:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信有幽灵的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to believe in ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.29,1:01:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是当我听到他们在电波中喋喋不休时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when I hear them chattering on the airwaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.92,1:02:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我你知道的 也许我们可以做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me what you know, and maybe we can make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.18,1:02:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道的不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.48,1:02:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Okay, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.19,1:02:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们藏在山里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hiding in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.44,1:02:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们攻击实验部 还有他们有很多孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they attacked WICKED. They got out a bunch of kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.03,1:02:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些 我就知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's all we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.53,1:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 豪尔赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Jorge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,发什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.33,1:02:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的新朋友们只是在互相了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my new friends were just getting acquainted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.54,1:02:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们了解完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.88,1:02:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 什么 你不是要帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait. You're not gonna help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.30,1:02:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.51,1:02:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带你们回去你们原来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you back to where you belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.22,1:02:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.54,1:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.17,1:03:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.92,1:03:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上你需要的东西 悄悄地收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack what you need. Do it quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.55,1:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.55,1:03:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 布伦达 这些孩子是我们的入场券\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real, Bren. These kids are our ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.89,1:03:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是对的 干将不会拒绝我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Right Arm can't turn us away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.43,1:03:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.58,1:03:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.41,1:03:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho, ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.00,1:03:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.75,1:04:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住 好了 一 二 然后推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha. Okay. One, two, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.54,1:04:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？- 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.88,1:04:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不够远 - 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not far enough. - Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.32,1:04:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就位 派人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In position. Send them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.45,1:04:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 米诺 大力点推她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Minho. Push her harder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.17,1:04:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.04,1:04:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.21,1:04:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}two… three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.80,1:04:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.55,1:04:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.30,1:04:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.57,1:05:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就这样 你就放弃这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you're just gonna give it all up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.99,1:05:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你建立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've built?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.24,1:05:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no future here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.58,1:05:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当另一帮人找到这地方会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when another gang finds this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了 我保护不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I lose control, and I can't protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.79,1:05:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.92,1:05:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你感染了闪焰病毒怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if you get the Flare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.63,1:05:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.63,1:05:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上你看着你变成那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain you up, watch you turn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你的头开枪 你是希望我这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a bullet in your head? Is that what you expect of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了我 我也会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do the same thing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.94,1:05:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.44,1:05:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是灾变的世界：杀戮地带部\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the World Catastrophe Killzone Department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.03,1:05:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经完全包围你们的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have your compound completely surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.86,1:05:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会发现自己拿了实验部的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find yourselves, through no fault of your own…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.74,1:05:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然责任不在你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in possession of WICKED property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barkley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.54,1:06:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安无事的还给我们 而我们会把这当作一个误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return them to us unharmed and we'll consider this a simple misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.87,1:06:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.46,1:06:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或你们可以抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can resist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.88,1:06:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.84,1:06:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们每一个都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and every last one of you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.46,1:06:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在病毒消灭我们剩余的人前 不会有太多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be long before the Flare wipes out the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.34,1:06:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,治愈的希望就在你们的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hope of a cure lies in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.14,1:06:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你们来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.98,1:06:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去带孩子过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.44,1:06:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.23,1:06:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去给他播我最喜欢的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna play 'em my favorite song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.99,1:06:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.65,1:06:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.54,1:06:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想惹到任何麻烦 好吗 我们只是想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not trying to cause any trouble, okay? We just got to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.04,1:06:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.62,1:06:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹森 我给你抓住他们了 我现在带他们下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janson, I got 'em for ya. I'm bringing 'em down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.46,1:06:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.09,1:06:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.42,1:06:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.27,1:07:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.69,1:07:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.82,1:07:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.62,1:07:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利 你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barkley, what's your location?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.87,1:07:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barkley, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.49,1:08:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你听到这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you hearing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.66,1:08:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.50,1:08:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.34,1:08:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有太多时间了 我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time! Let's go, let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.84,1:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.67,1:08:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是在跟我开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.51,1:08:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B, hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.01,1:08:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想去干将那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kids wanna get to the Right Arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.01,1:08:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你们去 但你们就欠我一个人情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lead you to them. But you're gonna owe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.57,1:08:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.73,1:08:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 快去 所有人快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Everyone, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.65,1:08:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.36,1:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 阿里斯 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Aris, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 往里面走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, push in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.33,1:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在顶楼 顶楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the top floor! Top floor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.21,1:08:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在上去的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.09,1:08:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.92,1:08:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 阿里斯 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Aris, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:08:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 下一个轮到你 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa, you're next. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 你在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda! Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.55,1:09:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快点去 我随后就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go. I'm right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.51,1:09:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.39,1:09:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法22在追 已经行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha 22 in pursuit. We're on the move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.19,1:09:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 回应啊 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda, come on. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.02,1:09:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.23,1:09:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我拿到了 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.07,1:09:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.03,1:09:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.74,1:09:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.04,1:09:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.33,1:09:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快点 我们没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry! We're running out of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.26,1:09:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在东面 - 切断他们去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the east! - Cut 'em off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got eyes on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.09,1:09:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.43,1:09:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 喔 喔 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, whoa, whoa. - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.93,1:09:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 站在原地不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stay right where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.19,1:10:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要抓活的 你绕过去 我追他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we need them. You go around. I'll go after them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那里 去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.74,1:10:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.87,1:10:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 我们在去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.12,1:10:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 歌快播完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! The song's almost over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.89,1:10:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.81,1:10:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.02,1:10:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.60,1:11:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.68,1:11:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.94,1:11:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我们怎么回去其他人那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. How are we gonna get back to the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.78,1:11:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 我要带我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. I'm gonna get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.20,1:11:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.12,1:11:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们要帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you helping us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.54,1:11:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这不是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it's not my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.13,1:11:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫似乎认为你们是去避难所的入场票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge seems to think you guys are our ticket to the safe haven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.55,1:11:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.13,1:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, paradise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.22,1:11:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受太阳威胁 不受感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from the sun, free of infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.39,1:11:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说干将带孩子去那里已经好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly, the Right Arm's been taking kids there for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.31,1:11:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是免疫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immunes, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.31,1:12:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你知道在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know where that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.03,1:12:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.11,1:12:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫认识个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jorge knows a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.42,1:12:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.59,1:12:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.53,1:12:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经偷运孩子上山\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to smuggle kids up into the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.58,1:12:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果豪尔赫出去了 那就是他会带你的朋友去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Jorge made it out, that's where he'll be taking your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.29,1:12:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he made it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.04,1:12:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问好多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask a lot of questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.50,1:12:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能就过来这里帮我打开这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just come over here and help me with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.01,1:12:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.11,1:12:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来不对劲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that doesn't sound good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.62,1:12:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.91,1:12:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面他们会很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here they'll be full term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.83,1:13:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.32,1:13:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.15,1:13:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.95,1:13:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人生活在这下面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do people live down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳风暴逼人到地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Solar Storms forced people underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.54,1:13:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫说 有很多定居点在这些隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge says there's settlements all over these tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.80,1:13:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那豪尔赫呢 他是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about Jorge? Is he your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.76,1:13:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.59,1:13:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 我真的不知道他是谁 他只是一直都在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I don't really know what he is. He's just always been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.35,1:14:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我一直都按他说的去做 不管多愚蠢都会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've always done what he's asked me to do, no matter how stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.85,1:14:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你不觉得干将是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't think the Right Arm is real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.03,1:14:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.20,1:14:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信希望是很危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}hope is a dangerous thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.24,1:14:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望杀我的朋友 比闪焰和焦土区加起来的还要多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope has killed more of my friends than the Flare and the Scorch combined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.21,1:14:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为豪尔赫会比他们聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just thought Jorge was smarter than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.22,1:14:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.40,1:14:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我觉得可能是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think it might be this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.58,1:15:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.91,1:15:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.29,1:15:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 看看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over here. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.59,1:15:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.32,1:15:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.74,1:15:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.84,1:16:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.01,1:16:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.52,1:16:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.85,1:16:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.03,1:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.49,1:17:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.67,1:17:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.47,1:17:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.49,1:17:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 快走 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.54,1:17:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.58,1:17:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.22,1:18:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.77,1:18:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.52,1:18:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.44,1:18:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 就在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.12,1:18:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.13,1:18:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 快走 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, go, go! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.89,1:18:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.81,1:18:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.40,1:19:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.28,1:19:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我去找下去的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, I'm gonna find a way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.79,1:19:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Brenda, don't move. Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.89,1:19:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.27,1:19:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda, grab my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.48,1:19:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.65,1:19:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.92,1:19:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会抓住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.23,1:19:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 - 我够不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brenda! - I can't reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.87,1:19:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.66,1:19:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.05,1:20:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.44,1:20:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从这下去 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get down here. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.28,1:20:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.33,1:20:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.00,1:20:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.13,1:20:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.30,1:20:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.24,1:20:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.81,1:21:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就去找马库斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go find Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.33,1:21:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.49,1:21:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量融入吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to blend in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.99,1:22:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确认是这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is the place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.75,1:22:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来是参加派对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here for the party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.83,1:22:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.88,1:22:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找马库斯 这是他的地方 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for Marcus. This is his place, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.21,1:22:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.43,1:22:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.26,1:22:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯不再住这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus doesn't live here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.56,1:22:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们去哪里可以找到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where we can find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.52,1:22:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 可以 他在B区那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sure. He's over in Zone B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.86,1:22:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 什么是B区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What's Zone B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.19,1:22:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,们烧尸体的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where they burn the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.70,1:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这样 有没有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, has anyone else been by here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这找过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群跟我们一样年纪的孩子 里面有个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Group of kids around our age? They had a girl with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.96,1:22:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色头发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.75,1:22:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我觉得他们可能在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… I think they might be inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.75,1:22:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.88,1:22:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.22,1:22:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.30,1:23:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,入场券\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price of admission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.56,1:23:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.36,1:23:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.00,1:23:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.55,1:23:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩 去享受派对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, enjoy the party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.27,1:23:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该分开找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.32,1:23:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看找不找到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can find the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.90,1:23:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.32,1:24:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drink anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.91,1:24:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.25,1:24:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.26,1:25:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.26,1:25:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.93,1:25:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.88,1:25:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}well… we should keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.73,1:25:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.77,1:25:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们也找不到干将了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't find the Right Arm anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.19,1:25:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有马库斯不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends are gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.03,1:25:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.66,1:25:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.20,1:25:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就尽量放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try and relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.33,1:25:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.96,1:25:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.25,1:25:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.86,1:26:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.57,1:26:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.13,1:26:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.08,1:26:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.89,1:26:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.81,1:27:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.43,1:27:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 有没有人看见你来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Did anyone see you come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.06,1:27:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.48,1:27:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有太多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.86,1:27:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, what's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.02,1:27:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 我要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had to see you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.82,1:27:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些事情必须向你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just try to explain things before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.11,1:27:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.32,1:27:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.36,1:27:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就听我说 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.57,1:27:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你告诉他们关于我什么 无论你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they tell you about me, whatever they say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.76,1:27:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要你知道 我必须要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to know I had to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.20,1:27:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.70,1:27:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.21,1:27:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不能眼瞧着他们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't keep watching them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.79,1:27:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.88,1:27:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.96,1:27:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.84,1:27:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.55,1:27:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.43,1:27:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.93,1:27:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.81,1:27:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要停止像这样见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop meeting like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.60,1:28:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 丑八怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, you ugly shank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.82,1:28:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你快开口 你这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest that you talk! You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.82,1:28:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.28,1:28:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.29,1:28:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要离开我的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to have to leave my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.62,1:28:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你一直玩得很开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you've been having fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.17,1:28:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不享受伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I don't enjoy hurting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.17,1:28:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.46,1:28:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干将在哪 马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Right Arm, Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.13,1:28:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, this is Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.14,1:28:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子很快明白啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid catches on quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.14,1:28:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动都听你指挥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the brains of the operation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.43,1:28:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你知道他们藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know where they're hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.39,1:28:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你告诉我 然后我就跟你做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tell me, and I'll make you a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.32,1:28:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.53,1:28:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就把那座桥烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned that bridge a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.65,1:28:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I made my own deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.95,1:28:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你教会我不错失任何一个机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who taught me, never miss an opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.17,1:29:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说供给和需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about supply and demand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.26,1:29:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验部想要所有他们能找到的免疫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}WICKED wants all the lmmunes they can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.43,1:29:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help provide that for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.93,1:29:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我引诱孩子进来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I lure the kids in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.10,1:29:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喝醉了他们玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}they get drunk, they have a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.85,1:29:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后晚点… 实验部来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, later, WICKED comes in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.10,1:29:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从中再挑选出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they separate the wheat from the chaff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.90,1:29:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变我的心意了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed my mind, hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.86,1:29:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很享受伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do enjoy hurting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.00,1:29:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说 说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk! Talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.33,1:29:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.00,1:29:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能保证任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not making any promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.09,1:29:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙很喜欢到处转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys like to move around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.34,1:29:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在山里有个前哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have an outpost in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.01,1:29:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它在很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a long way away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.31,1:30:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走到一半实验部就来追你屁股了 你永远也去不到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got half of WICKED on your ass. You're never gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.15,1:30:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠走路是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.40,1:30:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔特在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bertha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.86,1:30:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔特不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Bertha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.80,1:31:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想我们只能靠走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we're on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.09,1:31:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.96,1:31:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.51,1:32:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大家没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is everyone okay out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.72,1:32:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.02,1:32:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道枪手在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone know where those bloody shots came from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.60,1:32:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的 马库斯 他带我们去一个埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch, Marcus. He led us into an ambush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.95,1:32:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.62,1:32:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.95,1:32:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.66,1:32:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要转移他们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta create a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.96,1:32:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get ready to chuck it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.30,1:32:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.21,1:32:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备冲刺回卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get set to sprint back to the truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.72,1:32:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并堵住你们的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hold your ears!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.05,1:32:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.18,1:32:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.81,1:32:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.14,1:32:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.40,1:32:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 仍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.15,1:33:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.66,1:33:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.58,1:33:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往后退 - 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back up! - Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.16,1:33:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, over here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.33,1:33:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 别磨蹭 - 别做傻事 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's go! - Don't be stupid! Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.50,1:33:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.88,1:33:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.26,1:33:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 哈丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Harriet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.68,1:33:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. What the hell are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.77,1:33:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.85,1:33:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里斯 你很幸运我们没把你屁股打开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aris, you're lucky we didn't shoot your dumb ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.86,1:33:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.36,1:33:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.53,1:33:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.28,1:33:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前一起在迷宫里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the maze together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.12,1:33:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没危险 伙计们 出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clear, guys! Come on out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.70,1:33:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们没危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that! We're clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.54,1:33:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.38,1:34:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.72,1:34:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车吧 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up, Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.09,1:34:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.81,1:34:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带他们去基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking them to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.73,1:34:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那么你们是怎么到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so, how did you guys get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.82,1:34:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干将救了我们出来 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Right Arm got us out. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.57,1:34:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干将 你知道他们是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Right Arm? Do you know where they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.91,1:34:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.12,1:35:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直计划这个超过一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been planning this for over a year now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.12,1:35:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是给我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.83,1:35:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们很幸运找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are lucky you found us when you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.83,1:35:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天天亮就搬走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving out at first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.00,1:35:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Vince?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.00,1:35:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在那边某个地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere over there, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.29,1:35:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Vince?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.71,1:35:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个决定你能不能留下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who decides if you get to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.38,1:35:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为干将应该是一支军队啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the Right Arm was supposed to be an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.51,1:35:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.68,1:35:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们剩下的的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all that's left of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.19,1:35:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲了好多好人 才换来今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of good people died getting us this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.57,1:35:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.99,1:35:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是免疫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're lmmunes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.74,1:35:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山里碰巧遇上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught 'em coming up the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.32,1:35:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你检查过他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.74,1:35:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这家伙 阿里斯 我相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this guy, Aris. I trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.08,1:35:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信不过 检查他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't. Check 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.42,1:36:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.38,1:36:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda! Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.71,1:36:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.05,1:36:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda! Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.46,1:36:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.35,1:36:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 说话啊 - 抱歉 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brenda, talk to me. - I'm sorry. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.01,1:36:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.35,1:36:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 布伦达 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Brenda, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.68,1:36:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 说话啊 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brenda? Talk to me. - What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.94,1:36:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.90,1:36:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毒虫 我们有个毒虫 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crank! We got a Crank! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.27,1:36:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 等等 等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.94,1:36:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step back! - Listen, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.69,1:36:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是刚发生的 好吧 她还没有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just happened, okay? She's not dangerous yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.69,1:36:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不应该带她来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have brought her here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.03,1:36:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.20,1:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们让毒虫进来这里 避难所就持续不了一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let Cranks in here now, the safe haven doesn't last a week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.28,1:36:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 好的 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step back! - I understand, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.24,1:36:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.70,1:36:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就听我说 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.04,1:36:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 好吗 我告诉过她你能帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, okay? I told her that you could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.08,1:36:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.21,1:36:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有些什么你可以做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.71,1:36:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 肯定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.64,1:36:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以帮她从她的痛苦解脱 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can put her out of her misery. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.31,1:36:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.26,1:36:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 够了 放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, that's enough! Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.81,1:37:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被感染了 医生 没什么我们能对她做的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's infected, Doc. There's nothing we can do for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.11,1:37:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但他可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.32,1:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.24,1:37:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.25,1:37:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.29,1:37:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.25,1:37:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是把你放进迷宫里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes sense they'd put you in the maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.75,1:37:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I must admit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.80,1:37:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心 他们在你做了那种事后会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worried they'd kill you after what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.43,1:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.81,1:37:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们第一次交谈时 你说你再也承受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time we spoke, you said you couldn't take it anymore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.19,1:37:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你的朋友一个个的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching your friends die, one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.11,1:37:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最后一次交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time we spoke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.98,1:37:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我所有实验部 试验和实验室的具体坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gave me the coordinates of every WICKED compound, trial and lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.20,1:37:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你是我们的内线\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was our source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.45,1:38:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他我们就不能拯救那么多人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't have pulled all this off without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.46,1:38:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她到帐篷里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the tent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.46,1:38:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这些人拿些厚点的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these guys some warm clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.67,1:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.63,1:38:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.68,1:38:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是我们起码能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's the least we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.85,1:38:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.47,1:38:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要从你这取点血液样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get some blood from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.32,1:38:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始 我们就迷失了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beginning, we were lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.86,1:38:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we knew for sure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.32,1:38:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越年轻 机会就越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}was that the younger you were, the stronger your chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.54,1:38:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟实验部工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked for WICKED?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.54,1:38:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.42,1:38:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在一开始 我们是有最好的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, at first, we had the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.34,1:38:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出解药 拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a cure, save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.01,1:38:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然你们就是关键… 因为你们是免疫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was clear you kids were the key, because you were immune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.51,1:38:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.22,1:39:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终他们找到了答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, we found an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.85,1:39:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,由大脑产生的一种酶可以免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enzyme produced by the brains of the immune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.69,1:39:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦从血液中分离出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once separated from the bloodstream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.23,1:39:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以成为一种有效的药 减缓病毒的蔓延速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can serve as a powerful agent to slow the spread of the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.73,1:39:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你找到了解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you found a cure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.44,1:39:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.24,1:39:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,酶不能人造 只能从免疫者身上提取\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enzyme can't be manufactured, only harvested from the immune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.37,1:39:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有孩子有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.37,1:39:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这不会让实验部止步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that didn't stop WICKED.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.87,1:39:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们有他们的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they had their way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.08,1:39:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会牺牲一整代人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd sacrifice an entire generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.13,1:39:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.92,1:39:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化得出的生物礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift of biology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.38,1:39:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of evolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.89,1:39:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一个不意味着我们所有人都能认同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one not meant for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.49,1:40:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能活多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will that give her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.28,1:40:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都不同 也许几个月吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different for everyone. A few months maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.25,1:40:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过很难说 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's the catch, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.33,1:40:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll always need more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.75,1:40:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.42,1:40:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去外面吧 让她休息下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go outside. Let them rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.76,1:40:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.47,1:40:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.10,1:40:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.57,1:40:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她不能跟我们一起 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know she can't come with us, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.33,1:41:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.50,1:41:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.71,1:41:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? How are you feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.35,1:41:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.02,1:41:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远都能看到人最好的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always saw the best in people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.52,1:41:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现今在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.53,1:42:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.03,1:42:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们还是孩子的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were kids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.33,1:42:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被其中一个实验部营带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were taken in by one of WICKED's camps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.42,1:42:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给我们做了一大堆测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave us a bunch of tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.25,1:42:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't want me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.59,1:42:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们想要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted him, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.06,1:42:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至不让我道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't even let me say good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.82,1:42:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.53,1:42:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.22,1:43:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是查克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Chuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.10,1:43:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.48,1:43:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.62,1:43:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.55,1:43:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.47,1:43:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如有有任何事发生在她身上 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything were to happen to her, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.47,1:43:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.93,1:43:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进去 跟她聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get in there. Go talk to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.36,1:44:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想现在是我欠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I owe you, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.95,1:44:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冲出来了 这是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we broke out. I'm telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.68,1:44:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望阿尔比可以看见这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish Alby could've seen all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.43,1:44:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.06,1:44:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有查克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Chuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.86,1:44:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会为你感到骄傲的 你知道的 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be proud of you, you know, Tommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.11,1:44:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.78,1:44:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 阿里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Aris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.20,1:44:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.74,1:44:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点喜欢这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kinda like that kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.58,1:45:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 虽然我还是不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I still don't trust him, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.38,1:45:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 特丽莎在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where's Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.59,1:45:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她上那里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.07,1:45:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.57,1:45:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在上面这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.45,1:45:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在想事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.08,1:45:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我让你一个人呆着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll let you be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.34,1:45:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得你的母亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.51,1:45:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.93,1:46:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.10,1:46:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一个很漂亮的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a beautiful woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.86,1:46:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loved her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.19,1:46:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在实验部来之前她是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before WICKED, she was all I had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.41,1:46:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她生病了 我不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she got sick, I didn't know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.46,1:46:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把她关起来 藏好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just kept her locked up. Hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.67,1:46:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她会好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she'd get better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.97,1:46:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天晚上 她都会发出很可怕的声音 就像尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night, she'd make these awful sounds, like screaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.85,1:46:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一晚她没有叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one night, she just stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.77,1:46:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于安静下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was finally quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.23,1:46:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去她的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went down to her room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.78,1:46:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现满房都是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was blood everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.95,1:46:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她只是坐在那里 很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she was just sat there, calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.37,1:47:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她感觉好点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she was feeling better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.83,1:47:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的愿景实现了 她治好了她的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}The visions were gone. She'd taken care of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.04,1:47:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把她的眼睛挖了出来 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took her eyes out, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.80,1:47:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有上百万人在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are millions of people suffering out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.51,1:47:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有上百万个跟我一样的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of stories, just like mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.77,1:47:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能背弃他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't turn our backs on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.48,1:47:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.15,1:47:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么… 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.03,1:47:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说我要你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying, I want you to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.41,1:47:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.95,1:47:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.92,1:47:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.80,1:47:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别反抗他们 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't fight them, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.43,1:48:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.18,1:48:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.81,1:48:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下去吧 伙计们 包围他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, drop in, boys. Round 'em up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.70,1:49:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.29,1:49:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 'em out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.21,1:49:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.38,1:49:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站住 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.68,1:49:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.51,1:49:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈丽特 拿弹药来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harriet! Ammo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.18,1:49:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 哈丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince! Harriet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.64,1:49:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.23,1:49:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要我帮忙的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.27,1:49:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来掩护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to cover us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.94,1:49:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ammo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.69,1:49:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你知道怎么用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Do you know how to use this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.19,1:49:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.45,1:49:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fifty's our only chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.21,1:49:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.76,1:50:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dumb-ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.13,1:50:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.64,1:50:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你这是想找死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to get yourself killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.10,1:50:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.43,1:50:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在必须走了 趁我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go. Now, while we still have the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.89,1:50:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go find the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.06,1:50:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你看看那里 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Look! Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.86,1:50:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.36,1:50:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 快点 他们太多人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, hurry up! There's too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.08,1:50:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没弹药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.04,1:50:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.88,1:50:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.22,1:50:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.39,1:50:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.73,1:50:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.90,1:50:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没什么能帮得上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just nothing you can do for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.57,1:51:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不马上走 我们也好不到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't move now, we won't be much better off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.82,1:51:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys gotta go right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.57,1:51:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.58,1:51:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要的不是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.72,1:51:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会安全的 但你们应该马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe, but you have to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.79,1:51:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.75,1:51:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能离弃他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave without them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.13,1:51:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.18,1:51:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.59,1:51:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 我们要走了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bren, we have to go. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.60,1:51:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.25,1:52:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.09,1:52:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.10,1:52:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们排成一排 都跪下 抬眼往上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line them up right here! On their knees! Put some eyes up on that ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.31,1:52:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did we get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.65,1:52:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多全部人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them. Give or take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.40,1:52:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.61,1:52:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 跑了几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they lost a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.00,1:52:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.92,1:52:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.47,1:52:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.51,1:52:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.56,1:52:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.48,1:52:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.52,1:53:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他排到队里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.32,1:53:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.12,1:53:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.12,1:53:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.67,1:53:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.23,1:54:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是所有的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this all of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.40,1:54:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.73,1:54:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.28,1:54:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始装货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start loading them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.53,1:54:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.86,1:54:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们都听到了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you heard. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.28,1:54:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.12,1:54:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.30,1:54:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.09,1:54:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.80,1:54:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.10,1:55:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.47,1:55:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是跟他们一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.64,1:55:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.23,1:55:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎总是明白牺牲小我 成就多数的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa's always had an evolved appreciation of the greater good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.40,1:55:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重置她的记忆 只是时间的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we restored her memories, it was only a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.12,1:55:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.29,1:55:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.79,1:55:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有选择 这是唯一的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice. This is the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.12,1:55:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find a cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.59,1:55:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是对的 这一切只是为了达到目的的一种手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. This is all just a means to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.01,1:55:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前是很理解的 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to understand that, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.51,1:55:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你怎么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you think of me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.47,1:55:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是怪物 我是一个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a monster. I'm a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.60,1:55:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过毒誓要找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore an oath to find a cure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.85,1:55:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论付出什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.85,1:55:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要多一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.86,1:55:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}More blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.82,1:55:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.82,1:55:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望我们能再次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped we'd meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.03,1:56:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉在这种环境再相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry it had to be under these circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.66,1:56:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有很多事情感到很抱歉 但这不是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about a lot of things, too. But not this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.33,1:56:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我有良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least my conscience is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.71,1:56:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.55,1:56:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary? Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.84,1:56:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.51,1:56:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! Mary!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.89,1:56:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.85,1:56:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary? Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.69,1:56:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.36,1:56:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.65,1:56:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.03,1:56:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.37,1:56:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jansen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.74,1:56:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们上飞机 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load them up. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.70,1:56:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人 杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these people. Get rid of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.33,1:56:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.25,1:56:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.04,1:56:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼亚 阿里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonya! Aris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.50,1:56:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.42,1:56:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.17,1:56:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后退 - 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stand back! - Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.17,1:56:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人 别过来 - 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone, stand back! - Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.84,1:57:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 放他们走 - 托马斯 把炸弹放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stand back. Let 'em go. - Thomas, put it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.51,1:57:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放他们全部人走 - 你知道我不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let 'em all go! - You know I can't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.81,1:57:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 求你别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, please stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.52,1:57:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们做了个交易 他们保证我们会没事的 我们全部人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal with them. They promised we'd be safe. All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.10,1:57:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我应该相信你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm supposed to trust you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.69,1:57:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这是她唯一的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true. It was her only condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.94,1:57:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.27,1:57:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都可以回到原来的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything can go back to the way it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.36,1:57:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.28,1:57:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想他们都死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you really want all of them to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.28,1:57:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听她说的吧 托马斯 想想你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to her, Thomas. Think about what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.67,1:57:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们支持你 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with you, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.51,1:57:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.34,1:57:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.09,1:57:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 引爆吧 托马斯 - 我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it, Thomas. - We're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.55,1:57:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要回去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.18,1:57:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.10,1:57:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.02,1:57:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.88,1:58:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 快走 - 带她离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on! - Get her out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.51,1:58:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.67,1:58:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 把它放下 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Drop it, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.55,1:58:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.40,1:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.87,1:58:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.80,1:59:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.05,1:59:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.40,1:59:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持住 我瞄准你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.66,1:59:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.41,1:59:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 托马斯 快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Thomas! Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.00,1:59:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.17,1:59:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里 跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.92,1:59:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.43,1:59:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.10,1:59:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.76,1:59:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.73,2:00:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托马斯 回来 - 不 托马斯 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thomas, get back! - No! Thomas, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.23,2:00:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.90,2:00:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.74,2:00:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.65,2:00:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.45,2:00:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.03,2:00:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.16,2:00:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.74,2:01:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.71,2:01:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们重整我们剩下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we pick up what's left of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.42,2:01:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick to the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.59,2:01:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你们去安全港\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get you kids to the safe haven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.43,2:01:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们重新开始 我想是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we start over, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.69,2:02:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟你们去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.32,2:02:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.07,2:02:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过米诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise to Minho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.95,2:02:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离弃他 而且我要去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't leave him behind. I have to go after him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.71,2:02:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子 看看你周围 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, look around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.54,2:02:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验部刚重击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? WICKED just kicked our ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.30,2:02:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想你该去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think about where you're headed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.17,2:02:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有要求你们跟我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking anyone to come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.97,2:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.30,2:02:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识了米诺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known Minho for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.71,2:02:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我有记忆起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as long as I can remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.10,2:02:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果有任何方法…我们可以救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if there was any way that we could help him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.77,2:02:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我会在那里跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust me, I would be up there standing next to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.61,2:02:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 你在说的这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, what you're talking about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.61,2:02:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.95,2:02:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.99,2:03:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.46,2:03:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在知道我应该做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know what I'm supposed to do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.21,2:03:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是为了米诺 是为了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just about Minho. It's about all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.30,2:03:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有实验部抓过 还有要抓的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about everyone WICKED's ever taken, everyone they will take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.64,2:03:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远也不会收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.31,2:03:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远也不会收手 那我来帮他们收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never stop, so I'm gonna stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.98,2:03:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去杀了艾娃·佩姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill Ava Paige.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.65,2:03:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to admit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.32,2:03:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like some revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.67,2:03:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说的很动听 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a good speech, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.71,2:03:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你的计划是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your plan?{\r}
